<title>UK: Yorkshire crashes on Granada statement.</title>
<headline>Yorkshire crashes on Granada statement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in ITV company Yorkshire-Tyne Tees Holdings Plc crashed on Thursday after Granada Group Plc said it had no current intention of making a bid for the company.</p>
<p>Yorkshire shares, long supported by bid speculation, crashed 175p to 1105p before rebounding to 1150p at 1624 GMT.</p>
</text>
